            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nLong time\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nWe have not eaten at La Bettola since they were on Ho Tung Mau in D1....we ate there often as it was close. Once LB moved to D2 I guess you could say we were lazy lol! \n\nWell, we finally made it after nearly 2 years and were not disappointed! The food is as good as always, fresh and prepared just right. We will make the trip again as it is worth it! Need to work our way down the menu :)\n\nI recommend LB for sure!\nRead more\nWritten February 11, 2018",
