            "review_text": "priyank1209\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam42 contributions\n0\nGood Italian Food\nNov 2017 • Family\nVisited he place with mine and my sisters family. The Italian food is good and sumptuous though believe the menu is not so elaborate for a restaurant advertising itself to be best Italian joint. \nLocation wise it is perfectly situated and close to major D-2 attractions. Inside decor is also relaxed and welcoming. Staff and service outstanding. The kids zone on the outside is a major plus. Good place for kids or families with kids.\n\nOver all not an absolute 5-star facility but a definitely value for money family place for a relaxed evening.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2017",
