            "review_text": "astridcopenhagen\nCopenhagen, Denmark9 contributions\n0\nNot good pizzas!\nNov 2017\nWe had high expectations when we went to La Bettola, because we have heard that they have some of the best pizzas in HCMC. \nWe got very disappointed! The pizza was no good with way to much cheese and the dough wasn't good and there was too much of it. \n\nWe both felt bad the day after with symptoms of food poising - we don't know for sure if it was from the restaurant, but we didn't feel anything the whole day and a couple of hours after eating the pizzas, we both felt sick!\nRead more\nWritten November 8, 2017",
