            "review_text": "rati0naltraveller\nVietnam3 contributions\n0\nPoor service, good food\nNov 2017 • Family\nThis restaurant has serious problems with the staff.\nWe arrived at 18:45 and ordered simple food (pizza, pasta...).\nWe got served at 19:55.\nOne hour and 10 min. for baking a pizza or preparing a pasta is ridiculous!\nThe staff is extremely lazy and poorly trained.\nFor managing a good restaurant the first issue is how to train the staff.\nI suggest to look for some better organized restaurants (there is plenty in Thao Dien).\nBTW. Food was quite good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 6, 2017",
