            "review_text": "BeHappy858\nHong Kong, China117 contributions\n0\nItalian food in Saigon?\nSep 2017 • Friends\nI am always skeptical when it comes to going to a restaurant that serves food that has a different origin than the country I am visiting. \n\nI mean why would you be looking for Vietnamese food when you are in Rome? But once in a while, I get surprised and this is one of them.\n\nWhether you are just passing by or living in the area, if you happened to be in a craving for authentic Italian food, come here and you will not be disappointed.\n\nThe only comment about the service is that while the main server is very experienced and attentive, but she had too many tables to serve and the assistant server is just not qualified.\n\nBut I enjoyed the food so much that I went back again the very next day :)\nRead more\nWritten September 7, 2017",
